        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Additional Homes Now On Sale at Kilternan Village, Dublin 18\r\n\r\nNew 2, 3 & 4 Bedroom Homes.\r\n\r\nWelcome to Kilternan Village by Durkan New Homes\r\n\r\nDurkan New Homes are very pleased to share details on their newest development, nestled at the foothills of the breathtaking Dublin Mountains, Kilternan Village is more than just a development—it's a vision for a vibrant and sustainable community where people can gather, interact, and thrive. At Durkan New Homes, we are passionate about creating places of distinction that inspire connection and enhance quality of life, and Kilternan Village is a testament to that dedication.\r\n\r\nDesigned with thoughtful planning and a community-first approach, this mixed-use development combines beautiful homes, essential amenities, and green spaces to form a welcoming neighbourhood that caters to every life stage.\r\n\r\nFirst Steps\r\nDurkan New Homes have commenced works on phase one which will see the delivery of 83 no new homes with a range of mixes and sizes from 1, 2 bed apartments to 2, 3 & 4 bedroom homes of varying sizes.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the new homes the first phase of the new retail village centre will be delivered.\r\n\r\n\r\nYour New Village Centre\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the design is the Village Centre, a dynamic hub featuring:\r\n• An anchor retail store and boutique shopping to meet daily needs and support local businesses\r\n• A café and restaurant, perfect for catching up with friends\r\n• A creche for young families, offering convenience and peace of mind\r\n• A modern community facility, the ideal space for events and activities\r\n\r\nGreen Spaces & Active Living\r\nSurrounded by nature, Kilternan Village celebrates the outdoors with:\r\n• 7 nature trails spanning 6,700m\r\n• 9 public open spaces for recreation and relaxation\r\n• Over 1,250 trees planted to enhance the landscape\r\n• Outdoor exercise equipment for healthy living combined with running tracks\r\n\r\nA Community for All\r\nAt Kilternan Village, we’re not just building homes—we’re creating a place where the local community can come together and flourish. From parks and playgrounds to landscaped gardens and communal areas, every detail has been designed to encourage outdoor activity and foster social connections. Whether you’re exploring the trails, attending an event, or simply enjoying a coffee with neighbours, Kilternan Village is a place where memories are made and a true sense of belonging is found.\r\n\r\nAt this stage we are registering interest and will be in contact the coming months with further information. In the meantime if you have any queries please contact a member of our Sales Team: Savills (01-6181398) or Kelly Walsh (01-6645500)\r\nBER Details\r\nBER: A3"
      },
      {
